msgstr "Metabot provider 必須是字串，但取得：{0}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Model name is required. Expected format: connection/model, e.g. \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""
msgstr "需要模型名稱。預期格式：connection/model，例如 \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model for Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, e.g. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. The connection key names an entry in the `llm-providers` setting and defaults to the provider type."
msgstr "Metabot 的 AI 提供者連線與模型。格式：connection-key/model-name，例如 `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`、`openai/gpt-5.4`、`openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`。連線金鑰會指定 `llm-providers` 設定中的一個項目，且預設為提供者類型。"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model used for quick background tasks, such as naming Metabot conversations, in the same connection-key/model-name format as `llm-metabot-provider`. Defaults to the fastest model offered by the connection Metabot runs on."
msgstr "用於快速背景任務（例如為 Metabot 對話命名）的 AI 提供者連線與模型，格式與 `llm-metabot-provider` 相同（connection-key/model-name）。預設為 Metabot 執行所在連線提供的最快模型。"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Number of days to retain rows in the ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation, and metabot_message tables. Minimum value is 30; set to 0 to retain data indefinitely."
msgstr "在 ai_usage_log、metabot_conversation 與 metabot_message 資料表中保留資料列的天數。最小值為 30；設為 0 則無限期保留資料。"

