msgstr "Git sync 目前是否已啟用？"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "The remote branch to sync with, e.g. `main`"
msgstr "要同步的遠端分支，例如 `main`"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "An Authorization Bearer token allowing access to the git repo over HTTP"
msgstr "允許透過 HTTP 存取 git repo 的 Authorization Bearer token"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "The location of your git repository, e.g. https://github.com/acme-inco/metabase.git"
msgstr "你的 git 儲存庫位置，例如 https://github.com/acme-inco/metabase.git"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "Git synchronization type - :read-write or :read-only"
msgstr "Git 同步類型 - :read-write 或 :read-only"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "Whether to automatically import from the remote git repository. Only applies if remote-sync-type is :read-only."
msgstr "是否自動從遠端 git 儲存庫匯入。僅在 remote-sync-type 為 :read-only 時適用。"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "If remote-sync-type is :read-only and remote-sync-auto-import is true, the rate (in minutes) at which to check for updates to import. Defaults to 5."
msgstr "若 remote-sync-type 為 :read-only 且 remote-sync-auto-import 為 true，則以此頻率（分鐘）檢查可匯入的更新。預設為 5。"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "The maximum amount of time a remote sync task will be given to complete"
msgstr "遠端同步任務允許完成的最長時間"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "Network timeout (in seconds) for remote git operations such as fetch, push, clone, and ls-remote. A stalled connection would otherwise hang a sync indefinitely."
msgstr "遠端 git 操作（例如 fetch、push、clone 與 ls-remote）的網路逾時（秒）。否則，停滯的連線會讓同步無限期卡住。"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "Whether to sync transforms via remote-sync. When enabled, all transforms, transform tags, and transform jobs are synced as a single unit (all-or-nothing)."
msgstr "是否透過遠端同步同步轉換。啟用後，所有轉換、轉換標籤與轉換作業會作為單一單元同步（全有或全無）。"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "Time-to-live in seconds for the remote changes check cache. Default is 60 seconds."
msgstr "遠端變更檢查快取的存活時間（秒）。預設為 60 秒。"

#: metabase_enterprise/remote_sync/settings.clj
msgid "Allow specific remote sync behaviors. Set to overwrite-unpublished to allow overwriting unpublished changes on startup."
msgstr "允許特定遠端同步行為。設為 overwrite-unpublished 以允許在啟動時覆寫未發布的變更。"

